{"4633650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cluckin' Crash", "steam_appid": 4633650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐔 Cluckin’ Crash – About this product</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cluckin’ Crash is a chaotic asymmetrical multiplayer party game where one player takes on the role of a fleeing chicken, racing through a dangerous platform parkour from start to finish, while the other player tries to stop them using a vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In fast-paced best-of-five matches, a dynamic competition emerges between speed, precision, and pure chaos. As the chicken sprints through cities, deserts, or even low-gravity moon landscapes, the driver does everything possible to knock it off the platform, ram it, or cut it off strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is a series of intense, unpredictable matches filled with hilarious moments, narrow escapes, and spectacular collisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐔 <strong>Asymmetrical Multiplayer Gameplay (1v1 or Party)</strong><br>One player controls the fleeing chicken, while the other drives the vehicle trying to stop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 <strong>Physics-Based Chaos</strong><br>Every collision, jump, and crash feels unique and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Diverse and Wild Maps</strong><br>From urban cities to deserts and even low-gravity moon environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Best-of-Five Match System</strong><br>Fast, competitive rounds designed for short or extended play sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong><br>Simple controls with a high skill ceiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 <strong>Humor &amp; Chaos Focused Gameplay</strong><br>Unexpected situations, fail moments, and iconic “just barely survived” plays.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Gameplay Feel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cluckin’ Crash combines fast-paced party action with physics-driven chaos. No two matches ever play out the same — and that’s exactly what makes every victory (or embarrassing defeat) unforgettable.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐔 Cluckin’ Crash – About this product</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cluckin’ Crash is a chaotic asymmetrical multiplayer party game where one player takes on the role of a fleeing chicken, racing through a dangerous platform parkour from start to finish, while the other player tries to stop them using a vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In fast-paced best-of-five matches, a dynamic competition emerges between speed, precision, and pure chaos. As the chicken sprints through cities, deserts, or even low-gravity moon landscapes, the driver does everything possible to knock it off the platform, ram it, or cut it off strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is a series of intense, unpredictable matches filled with hilarious moments, narrow escapes, and spectacular collisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐔 <strong>Asymmetrical Multiplayer Gameplay (1v1 or Party)</strong><br>One player controls the fleeing chicken, while the other drives the vehicle trying to stop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 <strong>Physics-Based Chaos</strong><br>Every collision, jump, and crash feels unique and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Diverse and Wild Maps</strong><br>From urban cities to deserts and even low-gravity moon environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 <strong>Best-of-Five Match System</strong><br>Fast, competitive rounds designed for short or extended play sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong><br>Simple controls with a high skill ceiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 <strong>Humor &amp; Chaos Focused Gameplay</strong><br>Unexpected situations, fail moments, and iconic “just barely survived” plays.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Gameplay Feel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cluckin’ Crash combines fast-paced party action with physics-driven chaos. No two matches ever play out the same — and that’s exactly what makes every victory (or embarrassing defeat) unforgettable.</p>", "short_description": "Cluckin’ Crash is an asymmetrical multiplayer party game where a chicken sprints through wild platform courses while a driver tries to crash, ram, and knock it off the map. Fast-paced best-of-five rounds create unpredictable physics chaos.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633650/16b33db68024f76643ce267a72c9b6085005adac/header.jpg?t=1783502528", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633650/1b159888d189fd8762bddb33f34e23d386a246ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783502528", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4633650/1b159888d189fd8762bddb33f34e23d386a246ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783502528", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><l